{
 "EasySteer: Steering LLMs inside vLLM · REAL Lab Blog": "EasySteer: Steering LLMs inside vLLM · REAL Lab 博客",
 "EasySteer builds LLM steering into vLLM: extract or train a steering vector, attach it to any request, and keep 81–91% of vLLM's throughput, 10.8–22.3× faster than existing steering frameworks. EMNLP 2026 System Demonstrations.": "EasySteer 将大模型激活干预集成到 vLLM 中：干预向量可通过提取或训练获得，并可挂载到任意请求；吞吐量保持在 vLLM 的 81–91%，比现有激活干预框架快 10.8–22.3 倍。论文发表于 EMNLP 2026 System Demonstrations。",
 "Steering vectors as a serving feature: per-request steering inside vLLM, 10.8–22.3× faster than existing frameworks.": "将干预向量作为推理服务功能：在 vLLM 中按请求施加干预，比现有框架快 10.8–22.3 倍。",
 "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">Blog</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>November 17, 2026</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>LLM steering · Inference systems</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>12 min read</span>": "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">博客</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>2026 年 11 月 17 日</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>大模型激活干预 · 推理系统</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>阅读约 12 分钟</span>",
 "Steering changes what a language model does by nudging its hidden states at inference time, with no retraining. EasySteer makes it a serving feature: steering vectors are built into vLLM, attached per request, and cost only a small fraction of throughput.": "激活干预在推理时调整模型的隐藏状态，无需重新训练即可改变模型行为。EasySteer 将其作为推理服务的一项功能：干预向量内置于 vLLM，按请求挂载，仅损失少量吞吐量。",
 "<sup>1</sup>Zhejiang University · *Corresponding authors · EMNLP 2026 System Demonstrations": "<sup>1</sup>浙江大学 · *通讯作者 · EMNLP 2026 System Demonstrations",
 "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://aclanthology.org/2026.emnlp-demos.3/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Paper</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/EasySteer\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>Code</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/EasySteer/latest/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V3H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 5.5z\"></path><path d=\"M8 7h8M8 11h6\"></path></svg>Docs</a>": "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://aclanthology.org/2026.emnlp-demos.3/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>论文</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/EasySteer\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>代码</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/EasySteer/latest/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V3H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 5.5z\"></path><path d=\"M8 7h8M8 11h6\"></path></svg>文档</a>",
 "<a href=\"#why\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>Why steering needs a system</a>": "<a href=\"#why\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>激活干预的工程挑战</a>",
 "<a href=\"#how\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>How EasySteer works</a>": "<a href=\"#how\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>EasySteer 的设计</a>",
