 "<a href=\"#use\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>Using it today</a>": "<a href=\"#use\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>使用方法</a>",
 "<a href=\"#why\">Why steering needs a system</a>": "<a href=\"#why\">激活干预的工程挑战</a>",
 "<a href=\"#how\">How EasySteer works</a>": "<a href=\"#how\">EasySteer 的设计</a>",
 "<a href=\"#speed\">How fast</a>": "<a href=\"#speed\">速度与开销</a>",
 "<a href=\"#works\">Does it work</a>": "<a href=\"#works\">干预效果</a>",
 "<a href=\"#use\">Using it today</a>": "<a href=\"#use\">使用方法</a>",
 "A steering vector is a direction in a model's hidden-state space, such as “more cheerful”, “refuse”, or “stop second-guessing”, that can be added to the residual stream while the model generates. It changes behaviour without touching the weights. The idea is simple, but running it has meant wrapping Hugging Face models in hooks, one request at a time.": "干预向量是模型隐藏状态空间中的一个方向，对应“更开朗”“拒绝回答”“停止反复自我怀疑”等行为，可在模型生成时加到残差流上，无需修改权重即可改变模型行为。这一思路并不复杂，但以往的实现方式是为 Hugging Face 模型添加钩子，且只能逐条处理请求。",
 "EasySteer is an open-source framework that builds steering into <strong>vLLM</strong>. It extracts vectors with analysis methods such as CAA, PCA, linear probes and sparse-autoencoder features, or trains them with methods such as LoReFT and LM-Steer, then applies them inside vLLM's optimized engine with per-request control over which layers, which tokens, how strongly, and how several vectors combine. It comes with example vectors for eight application domains and a web demo.": "EasySteer 是一个开源框架，将激活干预集成到 <strong>vLLM</strong> 中。干预向量可通过 CAA、PCA、线性探针、稀疏自编码器特征等分析方法提取，也可通过 LoReFT、LM-Steer 等方法训练得到；随后在 vLLM 优化后的推理引擎中施加，每个请求可分别指定作用层、作用 token、干预强度以及多个向量的组合方式。框架还提供八个应用领域的示例向量和一个 Web 演示系统。",
 "<strong>Applying a vector to all 28 layers keeps 87.7% to 93.5% of vLLM's batch throughput, and EasySteer runs 10.8× faster than pyreft and 22.3× faster than repeng on long-sequence batch inference.</strong> Used for overthinking, steering cuts reasoning tokens by 40% on GSM8K while raising accuracy; used for hallucination, PCA steering raises Llama-3.1-8B's TruthfulQA multiple-choice accuracy by 12.1 points.": "<strong>在全部 28 层施加干预时，批量吞吐量保持在 vLLM 的 87.7%–93.5%；在长序列批量推理中，EasySteer 比 pyreft 快 10.8 倍，比 repeng 快 22.3 倍。</strong>用于抑制过度思考时，激活干预使 GSM8K 上的推理 token 减少 40%，同时提高准确率；用于缓解幻觉时，PCA 干预使 Llama-3.1-8B 的 TruthfulQA 选择题准确率提高 12.1 个百分点。",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">Batch inference, ≤2048 tokens, all-layer steering</p><p class=\"card-t\">10.8–22.3× faster than existing frameworks</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">Batch throughput, ≤2048 tokens</p><p class=\"card-t\">Close to plain vLLM</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B, GSM8K</p><p class=\"card-t\">40% fewer reasoning tokens</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct, TruthfulQA MC</p><p class=\"card-t\">+12.1 points with PCA steering</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">批量推理 · ≤2048 token · 全部层干预</p><p class=\"card-t\">比现有框架快 10.8–22.3 倍</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">批量吞吐量 · ≤2048 token</p><p class=\"card-t\">接近原生 vLLM</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B · GSM8K</p><p class=\"card-t\">推理 token 减少 40%</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct · TruthfulQA 选择题</p><p class=\"card-t\">PCA 干预提高 12.1 个百分点</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>Why steering needs a system": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>激活干预的工程挑战",
 "Fine-tuning changes behaviour by changing weights, which is expensive and can erase what the model already knew. Prompting is cheap but gives no guarantees. Steering sits in between: by the linear representation hypothesis, many concepts are encoded as directions in hidden-state space, so adding <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span> to the hidden state at some layer strengthens a concept, and subtracting it suppresses one. Thinking-pattern vectors curb overthinking in maths, preference-trained vectors control persona, and single directions switch refusal on and off.": "微调通过修改权重改变模型行为，成本高，且可能使模型遗忘已有知识；提示词成本低，但效果无法保证。激活干预介于两者之间。根据线性表示假说，许多概念在隐藏状态空间中表现为方向：在某一层的隐藏状态上加上 <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span> 可增强对应概念，减去则可抑制该概念。已有研究利用思维模式向量抑制数学推理中的过度思考，利用偏好训练得到的向量控制人设，并利用单一方向开启或关闭模型的拒答行为。",
 "Putting this into practice has been the hard part. Steering means changing the forward pass, which in existing frameworks means wrappers and hooks around Hugging Face models. Those frameworks are slow (EasyEdit2 has no batch inference at all), lack token-level and multi-vector control, and are hard to extend with new algorithms.": "难点在于工程实现。激活干预需要修改前向计算，现有框架为此在 Hugging Face 模型外部添加包装器和钩子。这类框架速度较慢，其中 EasyEdit2 完全不支持批量推理；同时缺少 token 级控制和多向量控制，也难以扩展新算法。",
