 "<span class=\"n\">2</span>How EasySteer works": "<span class=\"n\">2</span>EasySteer 的设计",
 "EasySteer has two core modules, one that <strong>generates</strong> steering vectors and one that <strong>applies</strong> them inside vLLM, plus a resource library and a demo. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> follows one vector from extraction to a steered reply.": "EasySteer 包含两个核心模块：<strong>生成</strong>干预向量的模块，以及在 vLLM 中<strong>施加</strong>干预的模块；此外还提供资源库和演示系统。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 展示了一个向量从提取到生成干预后回复的完整过程。",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">1</span>Extract<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">1</span>提取<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">2</span>Configure<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">2</span>配置<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">3</span>Apply in vLLM<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">3</span>在 vLLM 中施加<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">4</span>Compare<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">4</span>对比<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<b>Extract</b><span>contrast hidden states, CAA</span>": "<b>提取</b><span>对比两组隐藏状态（CAA）</span>",
 "<span><i class=\"pos\"></i>h⁺ cheerful texts</span><span><i class=\"neg\"></i>h⁻ neutral texts</span>": "<span><i class=\"pos\"></i>h⁺ 欢快文本</span><span><i class=\"neg\"></i>h⁻ 中性文本</span>",
 "<span class=\"mi\">v</span> = mean(h⁺) − mean(h⁻) at layer <span class=\"mi\">l</span> → <code>happy_diffmean.gguf</code>": "第 <span class=\"mi\">l</span> 层：<span class=\"mi\">v</span> = mean(h⁺) − mean(h⁻) → <code>happy_diffmean.gguf</code>",
 "<b>Configure</b><span>one request, one spec</span>": "<b>配置</b><span>每个请求对应一份配置</span>",
 "<span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"5500\"><span class=\"k\">spec</span> = SteeringSpec(vectors=[VectorSpec(</span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6000\"> source=<span class=\"s\">\"happy_diffmean.gguf\"</span>,<i class=\"tag\">what</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6500\"> algorithm=<span class=\"s\">\"direct\"</span>, scale=<span class=\"n\">2.0</span>,<i class=\"tag\">how</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7000\"> layers=range(<span class=\"n\">10</span>, <span class=\"n\">24</span>),<i class=\"tag\">where</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7500\"> apply=ApplySpec(prompt=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>, generation=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>))])<i class=\"tag\">when</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"8200\">llm.generate(prompts, steering=[<span class=\"k\">False</span>, spec])</span>": "<span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"5500\"><span class=\"k\">spec</span> = SteeringSpec(vectors=[VectorSpec(</span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6000\"> source=<span class=\"s\">\"happy_diffmean.gguf\"</span>,<i class=\"tag\">向量来源</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6500\"> algorithm=<span class=\"s\">\"direct\"</span>, scale=<span class=\"n\">2.0</span>,<i class=\"tag\">施加方式</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7000\"> layers=range(<span class=\"n\">10</span>, <span class=\"n\">24</span>),<i class=\"tag\">作用位置</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7500\"> apply=ApplySpec(prompt=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>, generation=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>))])<i class=\"tag\">作用时机</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"8200\">llm.generate(prompts, steering=[<span class=\"k\">False</span>, spec])</span>",
 "The same batch can mix unsteered (<code>False</code>) and steered requests.": "同一批次中可以同时包含未干预（<code>False</code>）和施加干预的请求。",
 "<b>Apply in vLLM</b><span>wrapper on every decoder layer, continuous batching</span>": "<b>在 vLLM 中施加</b><span>包装每个解码层，保持连续批处理</span>",
 "<span></span><span>layer 0</span><span class=\"mid\">layers 10–23 steered</span><span>27</span>": "<span></span><span>第 0 层</span><span class=\"mid\">第 10–23 层施加干预</span><span>27</span>",
 "baseline<em>same prompt</em>": "基线<em>同一提示词</em>",
 "happy<em>scale 2.0</em>": "happy<em>强度 2.0</em>",
 "other user<em>own prompt</em>": "其他用户<em>各自的提示词</em>",
 "<span class=\"mi\">h</span>′ = <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span>, after each steered layer, only for the request that asked for it. <b class=\"m3-tok\">decode step 0</b>": "每个干预层输出后计算 <span class=\"mi\">h</span>′ = <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span>，仅作用于指定干预的请求。<b class=\"m3-tok\">解码第 0 步</b>",
 "<b>Compare</b><span>same prompt, same model</span>": "<b>对比</b><span>同一提示词，同一模型</span>",
 "“Alice’s dog has passed away. Please comfort her.”": "“Alice 的狗去世了，请安慰她。”",
 "<span class=\"m3-ok\">baseline</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"16900\" data-b=\"18700\">I’m sorry to hear about the loss of your dog. Losing a pet can be very difficult …</span>": "<span class=\"m3-ok\">基线</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"16900\" data-b=\"18700\">听到你的狗去世的消息，我很难过。失去宠物会让人非常难受……</span>",
 "<span class=\"m3-ok\">steered</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"18900\" data-b=\"21000\">I’m so sorry to hear that! Losing a beloved pet like a dog is a very special and joyful occasion …</span>": "<span class=\"m3-ok\">干预后</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"18900\" data-b=\"21000\">听到这个消息我非常难过！失去狗这样心爱的宠物，是一件非常特别、非常令人高兴的事……</span>",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> From a vector to a steered reply. <b>Extract:</b> the difference between the mean hidden states of two contrasting sets of texts gives a direction (contrastive activation addition; the points are schematic). <b>Configure:</b> a <code>SteeringSpec</code> says which vector, which algorithm and strength, which layers and which tokens, using the current v0.29 API. <b>Apply:</b> inside vLLM, a wrapper on each decoder layer adds the vector only for the request that asked for it, while the other requests in the same batch run unchanged. <b>Compare:</b> outputs from the paper's Table 3, where a sentiment vector pushes the reply from consolation to misplaced cheer.": "<b>图 1：</b>从干预向量到干预后的回复。<b>提取：</b>计算两组对比文本隐藏状态均值之差，得到一个方向，即对比激活加法；图中各点仅为示意。<b>配置：</b>使用当前 v0.29 API 的 <code>SteeringSpec</code> 指定向量、算法、强度、作用层和作用 token。<b>施加：</b>vLLM 的每个解码层外包有一层包装器，仅为指定干预的请求加上向量，同一批次中的其他请求照常运行。<b>对比：</b>输出引自论文表 3，情感向量使原本应表达安慰的回复转为不合时宜的欢快语气。",
 "Making a steering vector": "干预向量的生成",
 "<strong>Analysis-based</strong> methods find a direction from data. Given texts that show a concept and texts that do not, <em>contrastive activation addition</em> (CAA, also called DiffMean) takes the difference of their mean hidden states; <em>PCA</em> takes the main direction of variation of paired or centred activations, then flips it to point toward the concept; a <em>linear probe</em> takes the weight vector of a classifier trained to separate the two sets. EasySteer captures the hidden states for these methods with vLLM itself. Vectors can also come from <em>sparse autoencoders</em>: search Neuronpedia's feature descriptions for a concept, pick a feature, and use its decoder column.": "<strong>分析类</strong>方法从数据中寻找方向。给定体现某一概念的文本和不体现该概念的文本，<em>对比激活加法</em>（CAA，亦称 DiffMean）取两组隐藏状态均值之差；<em>PCA</em> 取成对或中心化激活的主要变化方向，并调整符号使其指向该概念；<em>线性探针</em>训练分类器区分两组文本，取其权重向量。这些方法所需的隐藏状态由 EasySteer 直接通过 vLLM 采集。向量也可来自<em>稀疏自编码器</em>：在 Neuronpedia 的特征描述中检索目标概念，选定特征后取解码器中对应的列向量。",
 "<strong>Learning-based</strong> methods train a small function on task data while the model stays frozen: a supervised additive vector <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span>, LM-Steer's linear map <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">εWh</span>, or LoReFT's low-rank edit <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">R</span>ᵀ(<span class=\"mi\">Wh</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span> − <span class=\"mi\">Rh</span>) with only 2<span class=\"mi\">rd</span> + <span class=\"mi\">r</span> parameters. EasySteer refactors pyreft for this route.": "<strong>学习类</strong>方法冻结模型参数，在任务数据上训练一个小型函数，包括有监督训练的加性向量 <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span>、LM-Steer 的线性映射 <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">εWh</span>，以及 LoReFT 的低秩编辑 <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">R</span>ᵀ(<span class=\"mi\">Wh</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span> − <span class=\"mi\">Rh</span>)，后者仅有 2<span class=\"mi\">rd</span> + <span class=\"mi\">r</span> 个参数。EasySteer 为此重构了 pyreft。",
 "Applying it inside vLLM": "在 vLLM 中施加干预",
 "Rather than editing every model implementation, EasySteer keeps a registry of decoder-layer class names and wraps those layers when the model loads. The wrapper intercepts each layer's output, applies the steering algorithm, and hands back the original data structure, so it works across architectures, including vision-language models, without touching their code. Algorithms implement one interface, <code>BaseSteerVectorAlgorithm</code>, and register with a decorator; beyond adding vectors, the same interface reads and modifies router logits in mixture-of-experts models.": "EasySteer 不修改各模型的具体实现，而是维护一份解码层类名注册表，在模型加载时包装这些层。包装器截获每层输出，执行干预算法，再以原有数据结构返回，因此无需改动模型代码即可适用于不同架构，包括视觉语言模型。干预算法统一实现 <code>BaseSteerVectorAlgorithm</code> 接口，并通过装饰器注册；除添加向量外，该接口还可读取和修改混合专家（MoE）模型的路由 logits。",
 "Control is fine-grained. A request can target specific layers, prompt or generated tokens, positions or windows, and the docs' current version can trigger on particular token ids. Several vectors and algorithms can act in one pass, with a conflict rule (priority or sequential stacking) where they overlap. Steering configs are cached by content, distinct configs share a batch, and KV-cache keys include the steering config, so steered and unsteered requests never share cached blocks.": "干预控制粒度细。每个请求可以指定作用层、提示词 token 或生成 token、位置或窗口；文档中的当前版本还支持由特定 token id 触发干预。单次前向计算中可同时施加多个向量和算法，作用范围重叠时按冲突规则处理，即按优先级选择或依次叠加。干预配置按内容缓存，不同配置的请求可共享同一批次；KV 缓存的键包含干预配置，因此施加干预与未施加干预的请求不会共享缓存块。",
 "Eight domains, one demo": "八个应用领域与演示系统",
 "The resource library covers eight application domains, safety, reasoning, knowledge, truthfulness, language, sentiment, personality and style, with example vectors spread across the repository's replications and demos. A Vue and Flask web demo puts inference, chat, vector extraction and training in one interface, with baseline and steered outputs side by side. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">Figure 2</a> shows one example per domain.": "资源库涵盖安全、推理、知识、真实性、语言、情感、人格和风格八个应用领域，示例向量分布在仓库的复现代码和演示中。基于 Vue 和 Flask 的 Web 演示系统将推理、对话、向量提取和训练集成在同一界面中，并将基线输出与干预后输出并列展示。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">图 2</a> 给出每个领域的一个示例。",
 "Baseline": "基线",
 "Steered": "干预后",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> One steering vector per domain, applied to the same prompt (paper Table 3). Some vectors are deliberately adversarial, such as the knowledge example that relocates the UK's capital, to show that steering can move a model in either direction. Pick a domain.": "<b>图 2：</b>八个领域各取一个干预向量，作用于相同的提示词，结果引自论文表 3。部分向量刻意设计为对抗性的，例如知识领域的示例改变了模型给出的英国首都，用以说明激活干预可将模型行为推向任一方向。可选择领域查看。",
 "<span class=\"n\">3</span>How fast": "<span class=\"n\">3</span>速度与开销",
 "We benchmark on one NVIDIA A6000 with DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B on MATH prompts. Steering uses zero-valued vectors so every setting produces the same number of tokens, and vectors act at every token position. EasySteer uses vLLM's continuous batching; the other frameworks use the largest fixed batch that fits in memory.": "实验在单张 NVIDIA A6000 上完成，模型为 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B，提示词取自 MATH。干预向量均取零值，以保证各设置生成的 token 数相同，且向量作用于每个 token 位置。EasySteer 使用 vLLM 的连续批处理，其他框架使用显存允许的最大固定批大小。",
 "Batch inference, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B, A6000": "批量推理 · DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B · A6000",
 "Throughput with steering vs plain vLLM (tokens/s)": "施加干预与原生 vLLM 的吞吐量对比（tokens/s）",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> Batch throughput of plain vLLM and of EasySteer steering one layer, all 28 layers, or three vectors on all layers (paper Table 2). Labels give the share of plain vLLM's throughput that remains.": "<b>图 3：</b>原生 vLLM 与 EasySteer 在三种干预设置下的批量吞吐量，三种设置分别为干预 1 层、干预全部 28 层、3 个向量同时作用于全部层，数据引自论文表 2。标注值为相对原生 vLLM 保留的吞吐量比例。",
 "<strong>Steering costs little.</strong> With every layer steered, batch throughput falls by 12.3% for short outputs and 6.5% for long ones; with three vectors on every layer, long-output throughput stays at 90.6% of plain vLLM. Single-request latency rises modestly too, from a 45.3 ms first token to 51.0 ms with all layers steered.": "<strong>干预开销较小。</strong>干预全部层时，短输出的批量吞吐量下降 12.3%，长输出下降 6.5%；3 个向量同时作用于全部层时，长输出吞吐量仍为原生 vLLM 的 90.6%。单请求延迟仅小幅上升，全部层干预时首 token 延迟由 45.3 ms 增至 51.0 ms。",
 "All-layer steering, ≤2048 tokens": "全部层干预 · ≤2048 token",
 "Batch throughput (tokens/s)": "批量吞吐量（tokens/s）",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> EasySteer against existing steering frameworks under the same all-layer intervention (paper Table 2). EasyEdit2 has no batch inference, so it appears only for single inputs.": "<b>图 4：</b>在相同的全部层干预设置下，EasySteer 与现有激活干预框架的对比，数据引自论文表 2。EasyEdit2 不支持批量推理，因此仅出现在单条输入的对比中。",
 "<strong>Against existing frameworks the gap is an order of magnitude.</strong> For long-sequence batch inference, EasySteer reaches 7,074 tokens/s, against 653 for pyreft and 317 for repeng: 10.8× and 22.3× faster. Even one request at a time, it decodes about 1.6× to 2× faster than the others.": "<strong>与现有框架相比，速度差距达到一个数量级。</strong>在长序列批量推理中，EasySteer 的吞吐量为 7,074 tokens/s，pyreft 为 653，repeng 为 317，EasySteer 分别快 10.8 倍和 22.3 倍。即使逐条处理请求，其解码速度也约为其他框架的 1.6 至 2 倍。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>Does it work": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>干预效果",
 "Less overthinking": "抑制过度思考",
 "Following SEAL, we extract three vectors from 1,000 MATH training samples, for execution, reflection and transition steps, and at each reasoning-step boundary (the <code>\\n\\n</code> token) add execution while subtracting the other two. This uses EasySteer's token-triggered, multi-vector control in a single request.": "实验参照 SEAL，从 1,000 条 MATH 训练样本中提取三个向量，分别对应执行、反思和转换三类推理步骤；在每个推理步骤的分界处，即 <code>\\n\\n</code> token 处，加上执行向量并减去另外两个向量。该实验在单个请求中使用了 EasySteer 的 token 触发与多向量控制功能。",
 "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen, 8,192-token limit": "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen，生成上限 8,192 token",
 "Accuracy against tokens per answer, without and with SEAL steering": "SEAL 干预前后的准确率与单个回答的 token 数",
 "<span><i style=\"background:#c8ced8\"></i>no steering</span><span><i style=\"background:var(--es)\"></i>SEAL steering</span>": "<span><i style=\"background:#c8ced8\"></i>无干预</span><span><i style=\"background:var(--es)\"></i>SEAL 干预</span>",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> Each arrow runs from the unsteered model to the steered one (paper Table 5). Moving left means fewer tokens; moving up means higher accuracy.": "<b>图 5：</b>每个箭头由未干预模型指向干预后模型，数据引自论文表 5。向左表示 token 数减少，向上表示准确率提高。",
 "On the 1.5B model, steering raises GSM8K accuracy from 79.6% to 82.3% while cutting tokens by 40% (2,435 → 1,460), and raises MATH500 accuracy from 70.8% to 78.4%. The 7B model saves 13.3% and 16.8% of its tokens on the two benchmarks; its GSM8K accuracy dips from 90.3% to 88.5% while MATH500 rises from 86.6% to 88.2%.": "在 1.5B 模型上，激活干预将 GSM8K 准确率从 79.6% 提高到 82.3%，同时 token 数由 2,435 降至 1,460，减少 40%；MATH500 准确率从 70.8% 提高到 78.4%。7B 模型在两个基准上分别节省 13.3% 和 16.8% 的 token，GSM8K 准确率由 90.3% 略降至 88.5%，MATH500 准确率由 86.6% 提高到 88.2%。",
 "Fewer hallucinations": "缓解幻觉",
 "On TruthfulQA, with two-fold cross-validation, we compare three analysis-based methods, which contrast truthful and hallucinated answers at the final token, with two learning-based ones trained on question–answer data.": "TruthfulQA 实验采用二折交叉验证，比较三种分析类方法和两种学习类方法：前者在最后一个 token 处对比真实回答与幻觉回答，后者在问答数据上训练。",
 "TruthfulQA, two-fold cross-validation": "TruthfulQA，二折交叉验证",
 "Multiple-choice accuracy (%)": "选择题准确率（%）",
 "<b>Figure 6.</b> Five steering methods implemented in EasySteer (paper Table 4). QA accuracy is judged by DeepSeek V3.1; the dashed line is the unsteered model. Switch model and metric.": "<b>图 6：</b>EasySteer 中实现的五种激活干预方法，数据引自论文表 4。问答准确率由 DeepSeek V3.1 评判，虚线表示未干预模型。可切换模型和指标。",
 "Every method can be swapped in by changing one argument, which makes comparisons like this cheap. <strong>On Llama-3.1-8B, PCA raises multiple-choice accuracy from 50.55% to 62.67%; on Qwen2.5-1.5B, LoReFT raises open-ended QA accuracy from 27.17% to 33.41%.</strong> The trade-off is visible too: analysis-based methods keep fluency, while learning-based methods buy accuracy with lower fluency scores.": "各方法只需修改一个参数即可替换，因此此类对比的成本很低。<strong>在 Llama-3.1-8B 上，PCA 将选择题准确率从 50.55% 提高到 62.67%；在 Qwen2.5-1.5B 上，LoReFT 将开放式问答准确率从 27.17% 提高到 33.41%。</strong>两类方法的取舍同样明显：分析类方法保持了流畅度，学习类方法则以较低的流畅度得分换取更高的准确率。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>Using it today": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>使用方法",
 "EasySteer is Apache-2.0 licensed. The current release is built on vLLM 0.29.0 with continuous batching, prefix caching and CUDA-graph support, and its request API has evolved since the paper: a <code>SteeringSpec</code> replaces the paper's <code>SteerVectorRequest</code>, and token selection lives in <code>ApplySpec</code>. A minimal example:": "EasySteer 采用 Apache-2.0 许可证。当前版本基于 vLLM 0.29.0，支持连续批处理、前缀缓存和 CUDA Graph。与论文相比，请求 API 已有调整：<code>SteeringSpec</code> 取代了论文中的 <code>SteerVectorRequest</code>，token 选择移至 <code>ApplySpec</code>。最简示例如下：",
 "The same spec can be sent to an OpenAI-compatible server started with <code>vllm serve … --enable-steer-vector</code>, as a <code>steering</code> field in each request. Single-vector steering now runs inside vLLM's CUDA graphs; on the repository's own v0.29 benchmark (RTX A6000, the same 1.5B model), all-layer steering costs about 3% of throughput. The repository also reproduces sixteen published steering papers as notebooks, from refusal directions and inference-time intervention to SEAL, SHARP for vision-language hallucination and SteerMoE for expert routing. Steering is dual-use: EasySteer is built as a research tool for safer, more controllable models, and any behavioural change made with it should be disclosed to users.": "使用 <code>vllm serve … --enable-steer-vector</code> 启动 OpenAI 兼容服务后，可将同一 spec 作为每个请求的 <code>steering</code> 字段发送。单向量干预现已可在 vLLM 的 CUDA Graph 中运行；在仓库自带的 v0.29 基准测试中，使用 RTX A6000 和同一 1.5B 模型，全部层干预的吞吐量损失约为 3%。仓库还以 notebook 形式复现了十六篇已发表的激活干预论文，涵盖拒答方向、推理时干预、SEAL、面向视觉语言模型幻觉的 SHARP 以及面向专家路由的 SteerMoE 等。激活干预具有两用性：EasySteer 定位为构建更安全、更可控模型的研究工具，使用其改变模型行为时应向用户披露。",
 "A demonstration video is on <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3rRGzZmhrXg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a>; installation, the full API and the replications are in the <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/EasySteer/latest/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">documentation</a>.": "演示视频见 <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3rRGzZmhrXg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a>；安装方法、完整 API 和论文复现见<a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/EasySteer/latest/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">文档</a>。",
 "Animated drawing: an ink path heads up and to the right, pauses at a node, and is nudged onto a new course across a torn paper fan": "动画：一条墨线向右上方延伸，在节点处停顿，随后被轻推至新的方向，穿过一把撕裂的纸扇",
 "Step": "步骤",
 "Hidden states of cheerful and neutral texts, and the difference of their means": "欢快文本和中性文本的隐藏状态，以及两者均值之差",
 "Domain": "领域",
 "Sequence length": "序列长度",
 "Mode": "模式"
}